<title>USA: Westar Security acquires Safeguard Alarms.</title>
<headline>Westar Security acquires Safeguard Alarms.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kan. 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Westar Security, a subsidiary of Western Resources Inc, said on Thursday it acquired Safeguard Alarms Inc, a Kansas City-based security firm.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The purchase is the company's second security services acquisition in the Kansas City area in the past three months, Westar said.</p>
<p>Westar provides electronic security monitoring services to residential and commercial customers.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
